        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "          230 Poubauhmei Jisu Guang Zaic",
            "                           10.8.8.6.Ref. 8. 8. 8.6",
            "          Doh hej Eb",
            "",
            "          1. Poubauhmei Jisu guang zaic pwni the,",
            "             Baanch'ra ching ching lev muangh ruc khou.",
            "             Chamdaanv la tho kandihmei guay,",
            "             Kamei guang pwni the.",
            "",
            "                  Chamdaanv la tho 'zianmei guay le !",
            "                  Tingsaengc lak khe heic kandic hei.",
            "                  Kamei dincloumei lat guay hei,",
            "                  Zauh lo, guangtangc pwthe.",
            "",
            "          2. Kakhou lwmlou makmei kaguay tei mu,",
            "             Tingkauh ramgai how pwlak khe;",
            "             Ryanraa kapna bam pw sihnic,",
            "             Laalou dat pwlak khe.",
            "",
            "          3. He Tingkauh Jirusalem thanh gay tei,",
            "             Lwmloumei guay how pwni the.",
            "             Ch'rynmei thuakloumei lu thanh rui,",
            "             Pou' ta thuanc bam ni the",
            "",
            "          4. He adih gay ni cho tingkauh ramc tei:",
            "             Chwnsi ryanraamei nai lak khe:",
            "             Ringhmei thingbang lim gay khoutei,",
            "             Thuanc ni Halleluija"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
